{"id":"eje_rcito","lemma":"ejército","pos":"noun","rank":637,"glosses":["army"],"ipa":"/eˈxeɾθito/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ejércitos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ej%C3%A9rcito.wav","examples":[{"text":"Entró en el ejército.","en":"He entered the army.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821275"},{"text":"Napoleón dirigió a sus ejércitos hacia Rusia.","en":"Napoleon marched his armies into Russia."},{"text":"Me uní al ejército.","en":"I went into the army.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453964"},{"text":"Quiero unirme al ejército.","en":"I want to join the army.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594444"},{"text":"El ejército tuvo que intervenir.","en":"The army had to intervene.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684722"}]}